  "body": "Click the 3D Tour Link Above for an Immersive Virtual Viewing Experience.\r\n\r\nCall 021 185 6188 AMBER to make an appointment for private viewing.\r\n\r\nSOLD!  2 Irwin Lane has now been secured. Price on Application. Similar homes with the same floorplan are still available at 4–12 Irwin Lane. Get in touch today to find out more or arrange a viewing. Purchase directly from the developer and secure a brand-new home with confidence at exceptional value.\r\n\r\nLocated in the heart of Mairangi Bay/Rosedale on Auckland’s North Shore, Milenio by Oakland Group is a master-planned community combining high-quality residential living with a future commercial hub featuring retail, cafés, hospitality, and office spaces — creating a vibrant lifestyle destination right at your doorstep.\r\n\r\nWe are now offering freehold, architecturally designed duplexes:\r\n• 4 bedrooms + 3 bathrooms (incl. master ensuite)\r\n• Internal access garage + additional parking\r\n• Approx. 195.4m² floor area + 9.4m² balcony\r\n• Other options from 188 m² to 218 m²\r\n• Modern designer kitchen\r\n• Light-filled open-plan living \r\n• Excellent indoor-outdoor flow\r\n\r\nTop-Tier School Zones:\r\n• Rangitoto College\r\n• Westlake Girls High School\r\n• Murrays Bay Intermediate\r\n• Mairangi Bay School\r\n\r\nLocated minutes from Mairangi Bay Beach, with easy access to Albany, local shopping, and the motorway.\r\n\r\nSpacious design. Premium school zones. Thriving community.\r\nEnquire now — Limited 4-bedroom homes available from $1.349M.",
